 forward to hearing from you.\n\nBest regards,\n\nYaron Cohen\nFormal Dress Shops, Inc.\ninfo@formaldressshops.com\n(213) 400-7464',0),(10,'2026-01-30 21:26:19.309335',NULL,'Delia Rios Rosario','info@mardesabtq.com','+17879449097','Requesting login access as retailer','Puerto Rico','Puerto Rico','Hi,\n\nWe\'ve purchased from your company at the Atlanta Show.',0),(11,'2026-01-31 05:50:57.556070',NULL,'Armaan Zain','zainarmaan60@gmail.com','+31685296122','Ab s','Netherlands','New delhi','Nsnene',1),(12,'2026-02-18 05:40:56.202624',NULL,'Thomas Walker','thomas.walker@jmailservice.com','+318054002077','Let\'s Get Your Business Found Online - Fast','USA','CA','We make it easy for your business to be seen first and chosen first. You pick the keywords, and we put your banner at the top of search results - usually live within 24 hours.\n\nNo contracts, no long setup - just traffic and visibility.\nWould you like me to prepare a few keyword options for your business?',0),(13,'2026-02-19 21:28:22.499087',NULL,'Elisa OConnor','Jamisgrl@outlook.com','+18312397292','Dress HF110537','USA','Utah','I would love to try Dress HF110537 on.  Which stores in the US have one available in size 10?\n',0),(14,'2026-03-07 09:38:39.756465',NULL,'Testing','test@test.test','+917463848919','this is test','India','West Bengal','We are from IND',1),(15,'2026-03-10 08:14:22.346390',NULL,'Luciana Carlomagno','lucianacarlomagno375@gmail.com','+393383347930','Modello vestito cerimonia','Castrovillari','Italia','Vorrei sapere se questo modello di vestito è vostro',0),(16,'2026-03-12 10:01:19.126875',NULL,'Sonu Kumar','thesonukumar357@gmail.com','+918210490833','This is Subject','India','Jharkhand','This is Message',1),(17,'2026-03-14 09:59:29.925709',NULL,'Sonu Kumar','zipzapsunny@gmail.com','+918210490833','THis is test','India','Jharkhand','THis is test',1),(18,'2026-03-14 14:24:28.331672',NULL,'hourie boghossian','hourieboghossian@yahoo.com','+18184278608','Ordering dresses','United States','CA','Hi