opening !! ',0),(37,'2026-03-19 05:19:35.183334',NULL,'UDIT PRIYADARSHI','rashmi.handloom@gmail.com','+919934452332','MANUFACTURER','INDIA','BIHAR','Dear Sir/Madam,\n\nI hope you are doing well.\n\nI would like to introduce my export house RashmiHandloom , located at Bhagalpur, Bihar, eastern part of India. Bhagalpur is located on the bank of river Ganga and the city is globally known as \"Silk City\". \n\nWe are manufacturers of all kinds of Garments and Scarves/Stoles. We mainly use linen, silk & cotton natural yarns for products.  We are specialized in handloom fabrics. \n\nOur unique handloom fabric design and quality is something which makes us different from others. We guarantee products of the highest quality and best competitive prices. \n\nWe can send some of our collection through email as pics . We can develop your design as well according to your tech pack, forecast or mood board. \n\nKindly give us an opportunity to trade with you and assure you of best services. Currently we are working with many buyers across the globe and they are very satisfied with our services. \n\nLooking forward to your prompt response with your requirement. Feel free to respond with any query any time.\n\nBest Regards,\nUditPriyadarshi\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n',0),(38,'2026-03-21 19:22:00.558891',NULL,'Soondis Hamika','silhouettebridallv@gmail.com','+17024608370','opeming an account ','United States','NV','I am reaching out to express my interest in joining the Chic & Holland retailer network. We truly admire your brand and believe it would resonate well with our customers.\n\nAs we introduce new brands to our store, we typically begin with a smaller initial order to test customer response. With that in mind, I would love to learn more about your wholesale process and opening a retailer account.\n\nAdditionally, could you please share information on styles that are currently in stock and ready to ship—particularly dresses? This would help us move forward more quickly with our first order.\nPlease let me know the next steps, as well as any requirements or materials needed to get started.\n\nThank you for your time, and I look forward to your response.\nSilhouette Bridal\nSoondis',0),(39,'2026-03-27 22:36:33.902702',NULL,'Samuel Everett','samuel.everett@jmailservice.com','+318054002077','Predictable Traffic. Predictable Growth.','USA','CA','Every day people search for the exact services you provide.\n\nThe only question is — are they landing on your site or someone else\'s?\n\nWe allow you to secure specific keyword phrases in your industry. When someone searches those terms, your banner appears prominently and drives them directly to your website.\n\nIf you\'re interested, reply with:\n - Your website\n - The keywords you want to target\n\nI\'ll review availability and send guaranteed traffic numbers.',0),(40,'2026-04-01 15:52:24.706347',NULL,'Ketma ','ketma.leite@hotmail.com','+5511960991392','Become an stockist','Brazil','Sao Paulo','Could I please be registered to become an stockist?  ',0),(41,'2026-04-11 12:28:58.110208',NULL,'Bruna Romani','bruna.romani@hotmail.com','+5541999225920','.','Brasil','Paraná','Hi! How can we purchase the dresses directly from you?',0),(42,'2026-04-16 14:26:59.530197',NULL,'Athar','zain.athar60@gmail.com','+33758609484','test','Netherlands','voorburg','test',0),(43,'2026-04-18 11:37:25.119451',NULL,'Stacy Hall','stacy@baublebuy.com','+918360454517','Retailer for your designs','India','Chandigarh','Hi, we are a women occasion wear brand and really love your designs. We would like to showcase your designs and gowns on our store, and would like to become your official retailers. We have been in business for the past 6 years and have a lot of customers who are interested in designs exactly like yours. ',0),(44,'2026-04-19 18:10:31.913687',NULL,'Ana Inés Molinelli Magistrello','anainesmolinelli@gmail.com','+5493564207253','Prom','Argentina ','Córdoba,San Francisco ','Hi!I’m from Argentina,and i’m obsessed with your dresses,they are extraordinary,I really wanted to use one of your dress for my graduation,it was the one that used Lola Lolita at a Veniece festival I think,and I’m SO IN LOVE!Please come to Argentina I need that dress 😭❤️',0),(45,'2026-04-21 05:45:49.810702',NULL,'Marcus Palmer','marcus.palmer@jmailservice.com','+318054002077','Stop Fighting for Visibility','USA','CA','SEO takes months.\nPPC can get expensive fast.\n\nWe offer a different approach.\n\nYou secure specific keywords in your industry and receive guaranteed traffic from people actively searching those terms.\n\nIf you want details, send:\n - Your website\n - Your keyword list\n\nI\'ll respond with availability and traffic estimates.',0),(46,'2026-04-21 08:48:04.021688',NULL,'Shobhit Aggarwal','shobhit.jaikvik@gmail.com','+919458060926','Testing 1','India','Uttar Pradesh','This email for testing',0),(47,'2026-04-24 07:16:38.964181',NULL,'Ranya','rzwayhed@gmail.com','+96170944644','Wholesale-Flawless Boutique','Lebanon','Aley','Hello I would like to purchase some dresses for my boutique. ',0),(48,'2026-04-28 15:28:43.842232',NULL,'Eva Kovacevic','eva.lar78400@gmail.com','+31634766407','Retailing ','Bosnia','Republika Srpska','I am interested I your dress for my store ',1),(49,'2026-04-29 19:51:15.268588',NULL,'Sarra Adda','diamari.pro@gmail.com','+33688749824','Become partner','France ','Metz','Hello ! I saw you at the Barcelona wedding fair. I own a bridal boutique and would also like to sell evening gowns. Could you please send me your catalog along with your price list?',1),(50,'2026-05-02 15:49:50.321999',NULL,'Paula','contato@majesticatelie.com.br','+5511934568196','Retailer','Brazil','São paulo','i would like to know How to became a retailer here in Brazil. I own a dress store in Santo André - São Paulo called Majestic Ateliê. My Instagram:\nMajestic.atelie',1),(51,'2026-05-05 13:07:49.344671',NULL,'Rawan saidam','rawansaidam@gmail.com','+962796115055','buy a collection ','JO','amman','i want to be a retailer of chicandholland in jirdan',1),(52,'2026-05-05 13:11:53.669993',NULL,'Rawan saidam','rawansaidam@gmail.com','+962796115055','buy a collection','JO','amman','i love your collection, would love to buy bulk collection for my store in jordan',1),(53,'2026-05-12 12:23:30.996757',NULL,'Kathy Boosalis ','Katboo25@icloud.com','+13014013398','Dress shipped ','Usa','Maryland ','Hello, want to order a dress and need shipped over as soon as possible I have my daughter dressing for her sweet 16 and it hasn’t arrived yet and I’m getting wary of it if I order a dress when you guys how long would it take for you to get it to me?',1),(54,'2026-05-16 12:00:10.162443',NULL,'Armaan','zainarmaan60@gmail.com','+919873838988','Csc','India','Delhi','sdcadcacdf',1),(55,'2026-05-20 13:06:23.023927',NULL,'YINAN FAKIH','YINANFAKIH@GMAIL.COM','+584123567912','WHOLESALE','Venezuela','Distrito Capital','I hope you are doing well.\n\nMy name is Yinan, and I represent a multi-brand boutique specialized in bridal and evening wear, with presence in Venezuela (Caracas and Margarita Island).\n\nWe are currently expanding our portfolio and are very interested in learning more about your brand and collections. We believe your designs could be a great fit for our clientele.\n\nCould you please share the following information:\n\nLatest collections / lookbooks\nWholesale price list\nMinimum order requirements\nProduction and delivery timelines\nShipping options\nAdditionally, we would appreciate any relevant details regarding exclusivity or distribution in our region.\n\nLooking forward to your response.\n\nBest regards,\n\nYinan Fakih\n\nBridal Room Boutique\n\n@bridalroomboutique / @eveningdressboutique\n\n+584123567912',1),(56,'2026-05-20 15:14:02.800280',NULL,'Bryce Calabon','bryce@everythingformals.com','+13526465414','EFMM: Book Models for Upcoming Atlanta Market!','United States','Florida','Hi,\n\nI hope you’re doing well!\n\nI know Atlanta Formal Market this August is still a few months away, but I wanted to reach out early to offer our support for your upcoming events and showroom appointments during market week.\n\nAt EFMM, we’ve been working with major markets such as AmericasMart, Chicago Merchandise Mart, New York, and Las Vegas for over 10 years. We provide experienced professional models for runway, showroom presentations, print, social media content, and more.\n\nWe also offer event support including dressers, HMU teams, and sales assistants to help ensure everything runs smoothly throughout the event.\n\nWe are reaching out early to help you secure your preferred models for the event, as availability is becoming more limited due to early bookings from other designers.\n\nWe would love the opportunity to work with your team this season. If you already have an idea of the sizes, measurements, or style of models you’re looking for, feel free to let us know so we can start preparing options early.\n\nYou can reach me anytime at 352-763-0863 or Bryce@everythingformals.com.\n\nLooking forward to connecting with you.',1),(57,'2026-05-21 19:33:42.680828',NULL,'Galia Flores','Galiafloresch@gmail.com','+528672128719','becoming a retailer','México','Tamaulipas','Hello, I am interested in becoming a retailer for your brand. I believe your products would be a great fit for my business and customers. I would love the opportunity to work with you and build a successful partnership. Thank you for your consideration.',1),(58,'2026-06-04 19:08:44.645654',NULL,'Silva Kizil','Info@silvaavondmode.nl','+31407859326','I want to be a customer','The Netherlands','Noord Brabant','I have a retail store Silva Avondmode in Veldhoven The Netherlands. I would like to become a customer. Is that possible?\nKind Regards, Silva Kizil.',1),(59,'2026-06-06 15:03:44.514065',NULL,'Haley Wood','Hollywoodbridalandformal@gmail.com','+16623162330','Retailer approval ','United States ','Mississippi','Become a retailer for my Bridal shop in New Albany, Mississippi ',1),(60,'2026-06-16 04:35:24.486548',NULL,'Alessandro annunziata','quinkoottaviano@libero.it','+393335050491','Request to become retailer','IT','NAPOLI','Hello I am Alessandro Annunziata owner of a Boutique based in Ottaviano Napoli Italy. I am interesting to your collection and I\' d like to become your Retailer. How can I buy your collection? Waiting answer thanks before',0),(61,'2026-06-21 20:09:03.677219',NULL,'ANNA STELLA','architetto.stellaanna@gmail.com','+393381858215','NEGOZI IN UMBRIA','ITALIA','ITALIA','BUONASERA, IN UMBRIA C\'E\' IN VOSTRO RIVENDITORE \nATTENDO GENTILE RISCONRO\nGRAZIE',0),(62,'2026-06-25 05:26:51.243396',NULL,'Lexi lucks','Lexilucks@icloud.com','+15629007628','Retailer Lexi lucks ','United states','California','Hello Chic & Holland Team,\n\nMy name is Lexi Lucks, and I am reaching out to inquire about becoming an authorized retailer or stockist for Chic & Holland.\n\nI am currently Miss West Hollywood USA and will be competing for Miss California USA. I recently selected Chic & Holland gowns for pageant competition and content, and I believe there is a strong opportunity to introduce your designs to my audience, pageant network, formalwear clients, and the Los Angeles / West Hollywood market.\n\nI am interested in opening a wholesale account and would like to request information on your retailer onboarding process, including:\n\n* Authorized retailer application requirements\n* Wholesale pricing and opening order minimums\n* Current stock catalogs and upcoming collections\n* Size availability and fulfillment timelines\n* Territory or online retail policies\n* Drop-ship availability, if offered\n* MAP/pricing guidelines\n* Marketing assets and brand usage requirements\n* Payment terms, deposits, and reorder requirements\n\nMy goal is to build a boutique retail and content-driven sales channel around high-impact pageant gowns, formalwear, red carpet looks, influencer styling, and luxury event dressing. Chic & Holland aligns strongly with that market, especially for clients who want dramatic, camera-ready gowns with strong pageant and editorial presence.\n\nIn addition to retail sales, I can support the brand through UGC content, try-on videos, social media promotion, pageant-week content, photoshoots, tagged posts, and creator/influencer-driven product exposure. I would like to discuss whether there is an opportunity to combine authorized retail, content partnership, and pageant-market promotion.\n\nPlease send me your wholesale/retailer application, line sheet, current stock catalog, and any requirements to begin the approval process. I would also be open to scheduling a call with your wholesale or sales team.\n\nThank you for your time. I look forward to learning the next steps to become an official Chic & Holland retail partner.\n\nBest regards,\nLexi Lucks\nMiss West Hollywood USA\nLexi Lucks Productions\n]',1),(63,'2026-06-27 11:06:16.844731',NULL,'Aaleema Ansari ','aaleemaansari41@gmail.com','+918126281661','For Business ','India ','Uttar Pradesh ','I am manufacturer of women beaded dresses from India.\nI want to work with you.\nPlease give me a chance.\nI will do my best.\n\nI m waiting for you your answer.\n\nThanks & Best regards \nAaleema Ansari ',0),(64,'2026-06-29 22:28:25.670881',NULL,'Marilena Marra','Marilena84@live.com','+393894769048','Abiti da sera ','Italia','MATERA','Salve sono un imprenditore Italiano vorrei inserire nella mia atelier i vostri abiti ',0),(65,'2026-06-30 02:09:35.076683',NULL,'Sara Daniel','saradanielmasri@gmail.com','+525530374374','Gowns','Mex','MEX','I want to see the dresses , I saw you have in Mex where can I see them \n\n\n',0),(66,'2026-07-16 21:52:20.608671',NULL,'Carina Wakolbinger','carina@watek.at','+436644502212','Urgent','Austria','Upper Austria','Dear Sir or Madam,\n\nI am the person identified in the following two public retailer listings on your “Find a Store” page:\n\n• Carina Wakolbinger\n• Carina Wakolbinger-1\n\nThese entries disclose personal information relating to me, including private contact and location data. I do not consent to the continued publication or processing of this information.\n\nI hereby request, pursuant to Articles 17 and 21 GDPR, that you:\n\n1. immediately remove both listings and all personal information associated with them from your public website;\n2. delete the corresponding records from your retailer database, internal search index, map data, feeds, caches and backups, insofar as no legal retention obligation applies;\n3. prevent the listings from being republished or automatically restored;\n4. request the removal or updating of cached copies and search-engine snippets;\n5. inform all processors and recipients to whom the data were disclosed of the erasure pursuant to Article 19 GDPR;\n6. provide information about the original source of these records, the date on which they were collected and the parties to whom they were disclosed.\n\nPending the completion of this request, I also request restriction of processing pursuant to Article 18 GDPR.\n\nPlease confirm in writing that both records, including the address, telephone number and map references, have been permanently removed.\n\nMy details for identification:\n\nCarina Wakolbinger\nformerly Carina Nagl\nAustria\n\nIf you require reasonable additional information to verify my identity, please let me know. Please do not use the information contained in this request for any purpose other than processing my privacy request.\n\nKind regards,\n\nCarina Wakolbinger',1),(67,'2026-07-24 10:18:31.116346',NULL,'Neharika rajpal','Nourbyneharika@gmail.com','+919811510852','Becoming a retailer','India','Delhi','I am reaching out because I truly admire your brand and believe it would be an excellent fit for our clientele.\n\n We currently have a 2200 sq ft spacious and premium retail experience selling gowns from $1000-$2000 hence having a very niche and rich customer base that appreciates quality, exclusivity, and international fashion, and we are confident your collection would receive strong visibility and demand.',0);
